      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1992345176082137551",
      "url": "https://x.com/prince_OTMH/status/1992345176082137551",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/prince_OTMH/status/1992345176082137551",
      "text": "Yo, @VenomFoundation is about to smash 500,000 transactions A DAY and the chain isn’t even breaking a sweat.  \n\nMost blockchains start coughing at 30-50k tx/day and beg for mercy. Venom? Built different. Half a million and the tech’s just laughing: “Is that all you got?”  \n\nMagic under the hood:  \n- Dynamic sharding  scales itself, no babysitting needed  \n- Parallel execution  all running at once, zero traffic jams  \n- Gas fees so tiny you’ll forget they exist  \n- Actually compliant  banks & governments plugging in without lawyers losing it  \n\nThis ain’t some degens-only chain. This is real for:  \n• DeFi that won’t die when bulls run  \n• Countries going fully digital (Philippines already cooking 👀)  \n• Global payments that just… work  \n\nProgrammable money is coming, whether old world likes it or not. Venom laid the freeway while others argue over the map.  \n\n500k today, millions tomorrow. Quietest flex in crypto right now.  \n\nWho’s riding? Let’s split this $13,000 bag real quick 😂🚀  \n(link in replies, come get this bread)  \n\n#VenomBlockchain #BingXSpotBlast  \n\nhttps://t.co/yThDgnXM88\nhttps://t.co/AqaM7ZHFYk",
